  "description": "Go fast, go far, go fun\nThe Whyte Secta RSX is our top-of-the-range trail hardtail, built on 20 years of award-winning hardtail heritage. Designed and tested year-round in the UK's notoriously brutal weather, it's a modern hardtail mountain bike engineered to handle every trail and every condition.\n\nThe Whyte Secta RSX combines a fully-featured frame, confidence-inspiring geometry, capable componentry, and full weatherproofing – giving you the control and confidence to tackle technical climbs, aggressive descents, and all-day trail adventures, whatever the terrain or weather throws at you.\n\nHighlights\n– Fully featured, weatherproof 6061 T6 precision formed aluminium frame + SRAM UDH compatible.\n– 130mm RockShox Pike Select suspension fork.\n– Capable, smooth-rolling 29er wheels + 2.4in Schwalbe Albert + Romy radial tyres.\n– Shimano XT 1x12 transmission (30T chainring x 10-51 cassette).\n– Shimano four-piston hydraulic disc brakes (180mm rotors front + rear).\n– TransX +RAD full-insertion dropper post (with frame size-specific drop, all with 30mm of finely tuneable travel adjustment).\n\nIdeal for: Riders who want a versatile, lightweight hardtail for aggressive trail riding, technical climbs, and all-day adventures – but without the weight, complexity, or maintenance of rear suspension.",
